    {
        "content": "<p>When developing <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/42185\">#42185</a> I got hit by forbidden import. The file is placed in the Combinatorics folder following previous PR, though it mainly uses Analysis methods. The import <code>Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Summable</code> (needed by a single lemma <code>multipliable_one_add_of_summable</code>) generated the following import chain that's forbidden</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Modules</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">starting</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Combinatorics</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">are</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">allowed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">modules</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">starting</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Probability</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">This</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">module</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">depends</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">on</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Probability</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ConditionalProbability</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Probability</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">UniformOn</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">EssSup</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LpSeminorm</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Defs</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LpSeminorm</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LpSeminorm</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ChebyshevMarkov</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LpSpace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LpSpace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Complete</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ConvergenceInMeasure</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LpOrder</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">L1Space</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Integrable</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Integral</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">IntegrableOn</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LocallyIntegrable</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Integral</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Bochner</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Integral</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Bochner</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">FundThmCalculus</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Integral</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">IntervalIntegral</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">FundThmCalculus</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Analysis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SpecialFunctions</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">NonIntegrable</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Analysis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SpecialFunctions</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Integrability</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Analysis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SpecialFunctions</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Integrals</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Analysis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SpecialFunctions</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Complex</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LogBounds</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Analysis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SpecialFunctions</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Log</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Summable</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"n\">which</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">this</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">module</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Exceptions</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">can</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">be</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">added</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`overrideAllowedImportDirs</span><span class=\"bp\">`.</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>These imports are somewhat understandable till <code>Mathlib.MeasureTheory.Function.EssSup</code> -&gt; <code>Mathlib.Probability.UniformOn</code>. It seems that this import is just because <code>EssSup.lean</code> has some lemma about <code>ProbabilityTheory.uniformOn</code>, and is not really needed by the upper chain of imports. What is the best way to untangle this? (or is adding linter exception acceptable?)</p>",
